    "title": "City of Wichita Falls issues controlled burn notice: WFFD on-site - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Connor Nielsen ,\n6 hours ago\nWICHITA FALLS ( KFDX/KJTL ) — The City of Wichita Falls has issued a burn notice to continue over the next few weeks.\nAccording to a press release from the City of Wichita Falls, a private contractor will conduct controlled burns within city limits over the next few weeks. The burn will take place in the area behind Rosemont Cemetery on Southwest Parkway.\nThe burns will last from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m., and the Wichita Falls Fire Department will be on-site to monitor them.\nSmoke is expected in the area, especially during windy conditions. Residents who see fire outside the established burn area are advised to call 911 immediately.\nFor more information and updates, visit the City of Wichita Falls Facebook page .",
